<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Porter's five forces for software under agents, with one named example each. New entrants: easy to build, so everyone builds; Lovable, 400 million dollars a year with 146 people. Substitutes: why buy it if we can build it; Cloudflare rebuilt Next.js in a week. Suppliers: two labs, and they sell apps too; Anthropic's top model off for 19 days. Buyers, highlighted: same work for less; Persistent's clients want 25 to 30 percent off. Rivalry in the centre: everyone can write everything; IBM shares fell 13 percent after one Anthropic post)
/P 108 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/K 2
>>
